## H. RECOMMENDED FIX ORDER

### Priority 1 — System Cannot Run (Fix First)
1. **Add `estimated_seconds` to `ActiveJob` model** (ERR-010) — fixes primary crash point
2. **Fix `QueueResponse` schema** — make `estimated_seconds` and `created_at` optional with defaults (ERR-002)
3. **Fix `get_queue()` call** — pass `printer_id` or redesign all-queue view (ERR-007)
4. **Strip BOM** from 11 source files (ERR-001)

### Priority 2 — Core Business Logic
5. **Dispatch all files** not just `file[0]` in `dispatch_service.py` (ERR-004)
6. **Use `BASE_URL`** instead of hardcoded `localhost:8000` in `dispatch_service.py` (ERR-003)
7. **Move physical printer check** to agent-side API, remove from cloud assignment (ERR-011, ERR-024)
8. **Fix route ordering** — move `/health` and `/statistics/summary` before parameterized routes (ERR-008, ERR-009)

### Priority 3 — Security (Required for Production)
9. **Secure payment callback** — add shared secret or replace with real gateway (ERR-005)
10. **Add authentication middleware** — JWT on all endpoints
11. **Add file upload validation** — MIME type + file size enforcement (ERR-012)

### Priority 4 — Customer Flow
12. **Implement payment gateway** (Razorpay/PhonePe) or minimal UPI QR + polling (ERR-013, ERR-006)

### Priority 5 — Stability
13. **Fix async blocking** — `run_in_executor` for `handle_job()` in PRINT_AGENT (ERR-017)
14. **Fix queue stats enum comparison** — `job.status == JobStatus.PENDING` (ERR-022)
15. **Validate `SHOP_ID` at startup** in PRINT_AGENT (ERR-028)
16. **Add None guard** in analytics `Decimal(job.total_amount or 0)` (ERR-030)
17. **Fix printer delete** — use `.count()` not `len(printer.jobs)` (ERR-029)

### Priority 6 — Robustness
18. Implement `payment_service.py` with real gateway logic
19. Add job TTL / cleanup for abandoned QR-scan jobs
20. Add multi-agent routing by `agent_id` not just `shop_id`
21. Build owner/operator dashboard HTML templates
22. Add default pricing rule or onboarding check
